                      Welcome to self-host

                      self-host runs the Apps you pick on this machine with Docker Compose, and
                      sets them up for you: one Admin login, their API keys and the Links between
                      them.

                      Next you choose what to run, where it lives, who administers it and how it
                      looks. Then you review the plan.

                      Have you run your own server or used Docker before, or is this all new to
                      you?
                      > ○ New: this is all new to me
                        ● Advanced: I have run a server or used Docker

                      Nothing is written until you approve the plan at Review.






